    "body": "Why do you use `\\n` and not the `$line_break` [module](https://starship.rs/config/#line-break) (see below)? I would recommend using it, as it is the default and can easily be disabled with `starship config line_break.disabled true`.\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\\\r\n…\r\n[ ](fg:#3c3836)\\\r\n$line_break\\\r\n$character\"\"\"\r\n\r\n[line_break]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n```\r\n",
    "created_at": "2023-07-23T11:22:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T13:04:38Z",
