    "body": "One of the spaces should go along `$version` into the `()` block to avoid printing two consecutive spaces if `$version` is empty.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nformat = '[[ $symbol( $version) ](fg:#fbf1c7 bg:#458588)]($style)'\r\n```",
